<section class="bsr-section" id="faq">
  <div class="bsr-wrap">
    <div class="bsr-sechead">
      <span class="bsr-pill">★ Questions</span>
      <h2 class="bsr-display">What parents ask us most.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="bsr-faq">
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>What if my kid grows mid-season?</h3>
        <p>Bring the setup in and we'll re-fit them into the next size up. Included in every lease.</p></div>
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>How long is the season?</h3>
        <p>From pickup through the posted spring return date. Exact dates are confirmed in your reservation email.</p></div>
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>Do I need to know their boot size?</h3>
        <p>Nope. Give us your best guess online — we measure and fit properly at the appointment.</p></div>
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>What if the gear gets damaged?</h3>
        <p>Normal wear from a winter of skiing is expected. Damage terms are spelled out in the rental agreement you sign at fitting.</p></div>
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>Can I lease for more than one kid?</h3>
        <p>Yes — add a package per child and enter each kid's fitting details separately at checkout.</p></div>
      <div class="bsr-qa"><h3>When do daily rentals open?</h3>
        <p>We're building them now. Join the notify list above and you'll hear the moment booking goes live.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
